# Sim systems (design/handson.md §4–§6, §11–§13, T5): keys the sim emits that no data file names.
# English in every language until T9 (add these to handson_TODO.txt's list when translating).

ui.guest.forgiven
* I'll come back tomorrow.

app.bot.early_leave
* {name}: can I go at {time} tonight? My daughter is ill.

app.bot.early_leave.action.approve
* Of course

app.bot.early_leave.action.decline
* Please stay

app.bot.low_stock.drone_arrived
* The drone dropped off the order.

app.bot.regular_to_go.reminder
* {name} passes at {time} — to go, fast.

app.checklist.check_stock.out
* We're out of something — it's off the menu for a while.

app.payroll.star_card
* A thank-you card for the star of the week.

